BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:corfu-benitses-panigiri-of-agia-marina-benitses-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270716
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270718
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agia Marina\, Benitses
LOCATION:Benitses\, Corfu\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Benitses celebrates Agia Marina over two nights\, 16 and 17 July\, with a litany of the icon through the village and live traditional music on the harbour square\, food from the local associations and dancing. Agia Marina is also kept in Spartera\, Avliotes and Karousades the same night if you are in the north.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/corfu/#benitses-panigiri-of-agia-marina-benitses
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/corfu/#benitses-panigiri-of-agia-marina-benitses
END:VEVENT
