BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:corfu-corfu-town-litany-of-agios-spyridon-for-the-1716-siege-corfu-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270810
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270812
SUMMARY:Litany of Agios Spyridon for the 1716 siege\, Corfu town
LOCATION:Corfu town\, Corfu\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:One of four annual processions of the relics of Saint Spyridon\, patron of Corfu. The casket is carried through the old town accompanied by all three philharmonic orchestras. The August one commemorates deliverance from a 1716 Ottoman siege.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/corfu/#corfu-town-litany-of-agios-spyridon-for-the-1716-siege-corfu
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/corfu/#corfu-town-litany-of-agios-spyridon-for-the-1716-siege-corfu
END:VEVENT
